WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.032 --> 00:00:03.731
"What are cave vipers?" Loro asked.

2
00:00:03.732 --> 00:00:08.803
Raff's face was pale. "Cave vipers are deadly.

3
00:00:08.804 --> 00:00:13.879
And they're immune from magic—that's why they didn't show up on the map."

4
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:23.361
Zella frowned. "I wonder if they got down in the hole on their own, or if this is a trap to keep people from exploring the cave."

5
00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:28.340
"I doubt those vipers have been down there since King Zanta's time," Raff said.

6
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:34.269
Just then a burst of magic energy rushed toward them from across the hole.

7
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:40.934
"Did you feel that?" Raff said. "Something is giving off strong magic energy."

8
00:00:40.935 --> 00:00:44.142
"Maybe it's the Sovereign's Staff!" Zella said.

9
00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:46.519
"We should get over to that side!"

10
00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:52.246
"How?" Loro said. "The hole is too big to jump over."

11
00:00:52.247 --> 00:00:55.189
"Let's levitate over it," Zella said.

12
00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:59.762
"Are you serious?" Loro looked horrified.

13
00:00:59.763 --> 00:01:06.041
"Our magic is so weak down here. We could fall into that hole!"

14
00:01:06.042 --> 00:01:09.849
"He's right—it's too dangerous," Raff said.

15
00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:16.030
"Especially if Zanta did use this cave. There could be lots of other relics down here."

16
00:01:16.031 --> 00:01:22.624
Zella narrowed her eyes. "I thought you didn't believe it was really the Sovereign's Staff."

17
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:26.916
Raff shrugged. "Who knows what it is?

18
00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:30.389
But what if this cave is like the Cave of the Unknown?

19
00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:35.041
You told me your heroes weren't supposed to use magic inside that cave.

20
00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:38.145
It was too dangerous."

21
00:01:38.146 --> 00:01:41.908
"This isn't the Cave of the Unknown," Zella snapped.

22
00:01:41.909 --> 00:01:47.291
But she didn't suggest levitating again. Instead she turned around.

23
00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:52.113
"Let's keep exploring. Maybe there's a way over there through a different tunnel."

24
00:01:52.114 --> 00:01:57.666
"This is bad," Queen Venna said. "It's very, very bad."

25
00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:01.347
She and the others were gathered in the throne room now.

26
00:02:01.348 --> 00:02:09.554
Boz rubbed his long nose. "We should have destroyed all of the dangerous relics when we had the chance.

27
00:02:09.555 --> 00:02:15.093
The Mask of Zanta holds an unimaginable amount of dark magic energy.

28
00:02:15.094 --> 00:02:22.082
If someone with bad intentions puts it back together, it could give them immense power!"

29
00:02:22.083 --> 00:02:26.043
Zann winced as the queen glared at his grandfather.

30
00:02:26.044 --> 00:02:31.249
"What are we going to do?" he asked before the two of them started arguing again.

31
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:35.730
Zann's father shrugged. "There's only one thing we can do.

32
00:02:35.731 --> 00:02:41.126
We have to find those pieces of the mask before someone puts them back together."

33
00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:45.963
Zann shivered. He remembered holding the Mask of Zanta.

34
00:02:45.964 --> 00:02:51.124
The mask had recognized that Zann was a descendant of King Zanta.

35
00:02:51.125 --> 00:02:55.814
It had flooded Zann with a terrifying amount of powerful energy.

36
00:02:55.815 --> 00:03:01.126
"We should also investigate the report about the Sovereign's Staff," Zann's mother added.

37
00:03:01.127 --> 00:03:04.837
"If it has turned up, we'll need to do something."

38
00:03:04.838 --> 00:03:12.938
"I know." Queen Venna sighed. "That relic has unimaginable dark magic energy too."

39
00:03:12.939 --> 00:03:15.920
"I want to help," Perda said.

40
00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:19.772
Zann expected the adults to say no, as usual.

41
00:03:19.773 --> 00:03:23.619
Instead they almost seemed to welcome Perda's offer.

42
00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.819
"It's up to your parents, Perda," Queen Venna said.

43
00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:32.687
"But if they say yes, we'd be glad to have your help. Yours too, Zann."

44
00:03:32.688 --> 00:03:38.360
Zann's mother nodded. "You kids have proven yourselves to be strong and clever.

45
00:03:38.361 --> 00:03:41.085
And we're going to need all the help we can get."

46
00:03:41.086 --> 00:03:45.085
Boz nodded. "Gather what you need, everyone.

47
00:03:45.086 --> 00:03:48.999
We depart for Mount Mystery in the morning."

48
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:54.554
Raff was looking around a new chamber. He glanced up at his sister's cry.

49
00:03:54.555 --> 00:03:57.194
"Look over here!" Zella shouted.

50
00:03:57.195 --> 00:03:59.735
"What is it?" Raff asked.

51
00:03:59.736 --> 00:04:03.029
"I found another tunnel!" Zella sounded excited.

52
00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:06.861
"It looks like it's leading toward the spot where we felt the magic energy."

53
00:04:06.862 --> 00:04:09.447
"Are you sure?" Loro asked.

54
00:04:09.448 --> 00:04:13.464
"We've been wandering around so much that I've lost my sense of direction."

55
00:04:13.465 --> 00:04:18.394
Zella nodded. "It was hidden by a weak Invisible Shield spell.

56
00:04:18.395 --> 00:04:22.171
When I did a Clearing spell, it disappeared completely."

57
00:04:22.172 --> 00:04:26.350
Loro went over to her. "Be careful.

58
00:04:26.351 --> 00:04:31.697
If that tunnel had a spell hiding it, there could be something dangerous in there."

59
00:04:31.698 --> 00:04:36.725
"Maybe the Shield spell was weak because it was very old," Raff said.

60
00:04:36.726 --> 00:04:40.082
"It could have been set during the Old Times."

61
00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:43.548
He thought that might make his sister act more carefully.

62
00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:46.457
Instead, she looked more excited than ever.

63
00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:48.069
"Let's check it out!"

64
00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:50.397
She rushed into the tunnel.

65
00:04:50.398 --> 00:04:54.707
Raff was scared, but he didn't want her to wander off alone.

66
00:04:54.708 --> 00:04:57.374
"Zella! Wait for me!"

67
00:04:57.375 --> 00:05:01.035
They crept along as the tunnel sloped downward.

68
00:05:01.036 --> 00:05:04.658
Finally they reached an intersection with another tunnel.

69
00:05:04.659 --> 00:05:07.710
"Which way should we go?" Zella asked.

70
00:05:07.711 --> 00:05:09.835
Just then they heard a shout.

71
00:05:09.836 --> 00:05:14.087
Holding up his light, Raff saw the mayor rushing up behind them.

72
00:05:14.088 --> 00:05:19.124
"Stop right there, you two! I told you kids to stay away from this cave!"

73
00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:25.666
"S-sorry," Raff stammered. He looked around for Loro but couldn't see him.

74
00:05:25.667 --> 00:05:30.207
"We were just trying to help," Zella said. "We wanted to—"

75
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:32.796
"I don't want to hear your excuses!"

76
00:05:32.797 --> 00:05:36.970
Her face red with anger, Mayor Ruxton pointed.

77
00:05:36.971 --> 00:05:41.199
"Outside, now! And don't come in here again!"

78
00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:44.832
Even Zella didn't dare to argue with her.

79
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:50.791
Soon the siblings were back outside. Loro was wandering around the clearing.

80
00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:53.416
"There you are!" Raff said.

81
00:05:53.417 --> 00:05:56.457
"How did you get out here?" Zella asked.

82
00:05:56.458 --> 00:06:00.207
"Sorry." Loro looked sheepish.

83
00:06:00.208 --> 00:06:05.486
"I was feeling claustrophobic, so I came out for some fresh air.

84
00:06:05.487 --> 00:06:10.032
I told you I was turning back, but I guess you didn't hear me."

85
00:06:10.033 --> 00:06:13.582
Zella put her hands on her hips and glared at him.

86
00:06:13.583 --> 00:06:16.012
"Did you tell the mayor we were in there?"

87
00:06:16.013 --> 00:06:21.082
"Of course not!" Loro said. "Didn't you get my message moth?

88
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:23.697
I tried to warn you she was coming."

89
00:06:23.698 --> 00:06:28.124
"Oh!" Zella said. "Thanks for trying to warn us.

90
00:06:28.125 --> 00:06:31.791
She found us—and now she's furious at us."

91
00:06:31.792 --> 00:06:35.954
Raff nodded and shot a nervous look back at the cave entrance.

92
00:06:35.955 --> 00:06:39.719
"Let's get out of here before she comes back out."

